    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "club_itemmachine_msg_first_00",
      "hash64": "6C76D0975AF7CD8E",
      "text": "謝謝[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳設置了道具列印機。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "club_itemmachine_msg_first_01",
      "hash64": "6C76D1975AF7CF41",
      "text": "我是科學社的社員，\\n道具列印機就是本社團開發的。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "club_itemmachine_msg_first_02",
      "hash64": "6C76CE975AF7CA28",
      "text": "而我則是在拜訪各個社辦，\\n來協助大家操作它。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "club_itemmachine_msg_first_03",
      "hash64": "6C76CF975AF7CBDB",
      "text": "容我直接切入正題。\\n所謂的道具列印機就是……！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "club_itemmachine_msg_first_04",
      "hash64": "6C76D4975AF7D45A",
      "text": "把寶可夢的掉落物放進去，\\n再灌入ＢＰ後，\\r\\n就可以轉換出道具的裝置！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "club_itemmachine_msg_first_05",
      "hash64": "6C76D5975AF7D60D",
      "text": "它的結構是機密喔！\\n因為專利啊～什麼的都還在申請……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "club_itemmachine_msg_first_06",
      "hash64": "6C76D2975AF7D0F4",
      "text": "總之！它就是一種把掉落物放進去！\\n就可以列印出道具的優秀裝置！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "club_itemmachine_msg_first_07",
      "hash64": "6C76D3975AF7D2A7",
      "text": "會印出什麼，要印了才知道！\\n是不是很簡單？所以……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
